## Summary

Shipped a native SwiftUI/HIG **`GasPriceAutoPollPage`** at web parity (route `/gas-price`, P7 admin).

**What it does:** A thin page that frames the real, already-shipped `GasPriceSettings` surface with the web `PageContainer` title + subtitle, bound through an `@Observable GasPriceAutoPollPageModel` (no networking in the view, ADR-004). It resolves the two parity strings (`gas.title`, `gas.subtitle`) from `Localizable.xcstrings` and renders them from the bound model, emits the P1/S11 `view.opened` diagnostics on appear (native peer of `usePageTitle`), and is adaptive across macOS + iOS.

**Files (9):** page view + `@Observable` model + route registration (`Sources/Features/Admin/`), unit tests (`Tests/Unit/Features/Admin/`), `AppRoute` (`.gasPrice` case → `gas-price`/`fuelpump.fill`/`.account`), `TeslaSyncApp` composition wiring, `Localizable.xcstrings` (+3 keys, web names), `apple-ledger.json` (+2 rows, 2/2 done), and the evidence log.

**Verification (all real, in-scope green):**
